On this week's episode of <a href="https://podcasts.apple.com/podcast/iphone-duo-arrives-touchscreen-macbooks-next-up/id1602394741?i=1000797792310">The MacRumors Show</a>, we talk through the reception to the iPhone Duo as it goes on sale today, what to expect from next week's "Pro and tell" experience, and the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/23/ipod-25th-anniversary/">iPod's 25th anniversary</a>.<br/>
<br/>
